{title: Christ the Lord Is Risen Today}
{artist: Charles Wesley}
{genre: Easter}
{flow: Opening}
{style: Traditional}
{key: D}
{tempo: 100}
{time: 4/4}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 164장}
{title_ko: 예수 부활했으니}
{score: christ-the-lord-is-risen-today.abc}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Christ the Lord is [A]risen to[D]day, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[D]Sons of men and [A]angels [D]say, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[G]Raise your joys and [D]triumphs high, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[D]Sing, ye heavens, and [A]earth re[D]ply, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Love's redeeming [A]work is [D]done, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[D]Fought the fight, the [A]battle [D]won, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[G]Death in vain for[D]bids Him rise, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[D]Christ has opened [A]paradise, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]Lives again our [A]glorious [D]King, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[D]Where, O death, is [A]now thy [D]sting, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[G]Once He died our [D]souls to save, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[D]Where thy victory, [A]O grave, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D]Soar we now where [A]Christ has [D]led, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[D]Following our ex[A]alted [D]Head, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[G]Made like Him, like [D]Him we rise, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
[D]Ours the cross, the [A]grave, the skies, Alle[A]lu[D]ia
{end_of_verse}
